    <string name="ubuntu_consent_body">ThothTerm Ubuntu runs a real Ubuntu %1$s userland. This build does not include it, so it has to be downloaded before the terminal can start.\n\nDownload size: about %2$d MB\nFrom: %3$s\n\nWhat you are agreeing to:\n\u2022 This downloads executable software onto your device after installation.\n\u2022 That software is published by Canonical, not by ThothTerm.\n\u2022 It is not part of this app\u2019s package and was not built or verified by F\u2011Droid.\n\u2022 ThothTerm checks the download against a SHA\u2011256 checksum that is fixed in this app\u2019s source, and refuses it if it does not match.\n\nNothing is downloaded unless you choose Download Ubuntu.</string>
